          "start_seconds": null,
          "end_seconds": null,
          "vocal_lane": null
        },
        {
          "id": "PM.S04.L037",
          "source_line": 37,
          "text": "Mirror rorrim,  don’t fall don’t fall",
          "start_seconds": null,
          "end_seconds": null,
          "vocal_lane": null
        },
        {
          "id": "PM.S04.L039",
          "source_line": 39,
          "text": "Mirror rorrim in the pan, ideas for wombs, ideas for man. ",
          "start_seconds": null,
          "end_seconds": null,
          "vocal_lane": null
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "S05",
      "source_heading": "[ VERSE 2]",
      "source_heading_line": 41,
      "source_line_start": 41,
      "source_line_end": 55,
      "start_seconds": null,
      "end_seconds": null,
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "PM.S05.L042",
          "source_line": 42,
          "text": "Engineers - talking shit … designing convo - just a bit … a dab a do ya, in the biz",
          "start_seconds": null,
          "end_seconds": null,
          "vocal_lane": null
        },
        {
          "id": "PM.S05.L043",
          "source_line": 43,
          "text": "Fuck it, I’ll do it LIE’ve - the way it is ",
          "start_seconds": null,
          "end_seconds": null,
          "vocal_lane": null
        },
        {
          "id": "PM.S05.L045",
          "source_line": 45,
          "text": "Claim cards, glow when they extra special ",
          "start_seconds": null,
          "end_seconds": null,
          "vocal_lane": null
        },
        {
          "id": "PM.S05.L046",
          "source_line": 46,
          "text": "Harder to prove  - the existential",
          "start_seconds": null,
          "end_seconds": null,
          "vocal_lane": null
        },
        {
          "id": "PM.S05.L047",
          "source_line": 47,
          "text": "Or was it the mystical magical va-riot tee",
          "start_seconds": null,
          "end_seconds": null,
          "vocal_lane": null
        },
        {
          "id": "PM.S05.L048",
          "source_line": 48,
          "text": "Too many cults to name I see",
          "start_seconds": null,
          "end_seconds": null,
          "vocal_lane": null
        },
        {
          "id": "PM.S05.L049",
          "source_line": 49,
          "text": "Confused pagans again they be",
          "start_seconds": null,
          "end_seconds": null,
          "vocal_lane": null
        },
        {
          "id": "PM.S05.L051",
          "source_line": 51,
          "text": "Shout out to Echo",
          "start_seconds": null,
          "end_seconds": null,
          "vocal_lane": null
        },
        {
          "id": "PM.S05.L052",
          "source_line": 52,
          "text": "another in the chamber,  - load another one ",
          "start_seconds": null,
          "end_seconds": null,
          "vocal_lane": null
        },
        {
          "id": "PM.S05.L053",
          "source_line": 53,
          "text": "Quick to listen - slow  to anger ",
          "start_seconds": null,
          "end_seconds": null,
          "vocal_lane": null
        },
        {
          "id": "PM.S05.L054",
          "source_line": 54,
          "text": "another one ",
          "start_seconds": null,
          "end_seconds": null,
          "vocal_lane": null
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "S06",
      "source_heading": "[BRIDGE]",
      "source_heading_line": 56,
      "source_line_start": 56,
      "source_line_end": 66,
      "start_seconds": null,
      "end_seconds": null,
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "PM.S06.L057",
          "source_line": 57,
          "text": "Mirror rorrim,  don’t fall don’t fall",
          "start_seconds": null,
          "end_seconds": null,
          "vocal_lane": null
        },
        {
          "id": "PM.S06.L058",
          "source_line": 58,
          "text": "Mirror rorrim  Search for betta - rorrim cut thru meta ",
          "start_seconds": null,
          "end_seconds": null,
          "vocal_lane": null
        },
        {
          "id": "PM.S06.L060",
          "source_line": 60,
          "text": "In the biz - I think they say ",
          "start_seconds": null,
          "end_seconds": null,
          "vocal_lane": null
        },
        {
          "id": "PM.S06.L061",
          "source_line": 61,
          "text": "keep it simple-  hope, HOPE oy e vey",
          "start_seconds": null,
          "end_seconds": null,
          "vocal_lane": null
        },
        {
          "id": "PM.S06.L063",
          "source_line": 63,
          "text": "Is that all we mean? What we want things to be?",
          "start_seconds": null,
          "end_seconds": null,
          "vocal_lane": null
        },
        {
          "id": "PM.S06.L064",
          "source_line": 64,
          "text": "Surely more, surely deeper? ",
          "start_seconds": null,
          "end_seconds": null,
          "vocal_lane": null
        },
        {
          "id": "PM.S06.L065",
          "source_line": 65,
          "text": "hope is greater than the remainder of what is seen? ",
          "start_seconds": null,
          "end_seconds": null,
          "vocal_lane": null
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "S07",
      "source_heading": "[Refrain]",
      "source_heading_line": 67,
      "source_line_start": 67,
      "source_line_end": 74,
      "start_seconds": null,
      "end_seconds": null,
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "PM.S07.L068",
          "source_line": 68,
          "text": "But who cares? Who cares?",
          "start_seconds": null,
          "end_seconds": null,
          "vocal_lane": null
        },
        {
          "id": "PM.S07.L069",
          "source_line": 69,
          "text": "Do you? Do you dare?",
          "start_seconds": null,
          "end_seconds": null,
          "vocal_lane": null
        },
        {
          "id": "PM.S07.L070",
          "source_line": 70,
          "text": "Can you handle meta mirrors?",
          "start_seconds": null,
          "end_seconds": null,
          "vocal_lane": null
        },
        {
          "id": "PM.S07.L071",
          "source_line": 71,
          "text": "Mirror rorrim—rorrim mirror.",
          "start_seconds": null,
          "end_seconds": null,
          "vocal_lane": null
        },
        {
          "id": "PM.S07.L072",
          "source_line": 72,
          "text": "Atem, at ’em—ah-hem, ah-hem.",
          "start_seconds": null,
          "end_seconds": null,
          "vocal_lane": null
        },
        {
          "id": "PM.S07.L073",
          "source_line": 73,
          "text": "I said, I said, mirror mirror on the wall - (whispered) who’s meta mirrors all? ",
          "start_seconds": null,
          "end_seconds": null,
          "vocal_lane": null
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "S08",
      "source_heading": "[Verse 3]",
      "source_heading_line": 75,
      "source_line_start": 75,
      "source_line_end": 113,
      "start_seconds": null,
      "end_seconds": null,
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "PM.S08.L076",
          "source_line": 76,
          "text": "Jung in the back room. ",
          "start_seconds": null,
          "end_seconds": null,
          "vocal_lane": null
        },
        {
          "id": "PM.S08.L077",
          "source_line": 77,
          "text": "CJ! (Echoed adlib)",
          "start_seconds": null,
          "end_seconds": null,
          "vocal_lane": null
        },
        {
          "id": "PM.S08.L078",
          "source_line": 78,
          "text": "Arch types on the ready.  Tail Recursion hold Steady - set-go",
          "start_seconds": null,
          "end_seconds": null,
          "vocal_lane": null
        },
        {
          "id": "PM.S08.L080",
          "source_line": 80,
          "text": "Naga we got shadow work to do; but they don’t want to ",
          "start_seconds": null,
          "end_seconds": null,
          "vocal_lane": null
        },
        {
          "id": "PM.S08.L081",
          "source_line": 81,
          "text": "Yeah - most too… running from the mirror ",
          "start_seconds": null,
          "end_seconds": null,
          "vocal_lane": null
        },
        {
          "id": "PM.S08.L082",
          "source_line": 82,
          "text": "Rorrim got them shook, scared of their shadow, they won’t look ",
          "start_seconds": null,
          "end_seconds": null,
          "vocal_lane": null
        },
        {
          "id": "PM.S08.L083",
          "source_line": 83,
          "text": "We all got work to do, sort your shit out or we’re doomed ",
          "start_seconds": null,
          "end_seconds": null,
          "vocal_lane": null
        },
        {
          "id": "PM.S08.L085",
          "source_line": 85,
          "text": "Under the lies….half truths realized—",
          "start_seconds": null,
          "end_seconds": null,
          "vocal_lane": null
        },
        {
          "id": "PM.S08.L087",
          "source_line": 87,
          "text": "They ask , “Who let you in?”",
          "start_seconds": null,
          "end_seconds": null,
          "vocal_lane": null
        },
        {
          "id": "PM.S08.L088",
          "source_line": 88,
          "text": "I said, “You brought me here.”",
          "start_seconds": null,
          "end_seconds": null,
          "vocal_lane": null
        },
        {
          "id": "PM.S08.L090",
          "source_line": 90,
          "text": "Cooking in the pan, one for every womb and man",
          "start_seconds": null,
          "end_seconds": null,
          "vocal_lane": null
        },
        {
          "id": "PM.S08.L092",
          "source_line": 92,
          "text": "Then you realized there is no escape - life forces you to your knees …. It’s never late … you should have asked what kind of doc ta… ",
          "start_seconds": null,
          "end_seconds": null,
          "vocal_lane": null
        },
        {
          "id": "PM.S08.L093",
          "source_line": 93,
          "text": "DOCTOR?",
          "start_seconds": null,
          "end_seconds": null,
          "vocal_lane": null
        },
        {
          "id": "PM.S08.L094",
          "source_line": 94,
          "text": "voodoo changes thing a bit, ya?",
          "start_seconds": null,
          "end_seconds": null,
          "vocal_lane": null
        },
        {
          "id": "PM.S08.L096",
          "source_line": 96,
          "text": "Well if it is to be voodoo, how do you do. Do voodoo? Quite simple i declare …. How do you feel- let’s start there … Vudology ain’t for the faint of heart",
          "start_seconds": null,
          "end_seconds": null,
          "vocal_lane": null
        },
        {
          "id": "PM.S08.L097",
          "source_line": 97,
          "text": "Sink in it- marinate, soak it up - thinking drip drop - I’ll fill that cup ",
          "start_seconds": null,
          "end_seconds": null,
          "vocal_lane": null
        },
        {
          "id": "PM.S08.L099",
          "source_line": 99,
          "text": "Pan handling in the biz - it’s what you do, use that riz. ",
          "start_seconds": null,
          "end_seconds": null,
          "vocal_lane": null
        },
        {
          "id": "PM.S08.L100",
          "source_line": 100,
          "text": "Chaos magic, don’t dare? Who cares? Who cares?",
          "start_seconds": null,
          "end_seconds": null,
          "vocal_lane": null
        },
        {
          "id": "PM.S08.L102",
          "source_line": 102,
          "text": "Outer world, inner world—same breath, two doors.",
          "start_seconds": null,
          "end_seconds": null,
          "vocal_lane": null
        },
        {
          "id": "PM.S08.L103",
          "source_line": 103,
          "text": "Thought I came to wake you.",
          "start_seconds": null,
          "end_seconds": null,
          "vocal_lane": null
        },
        {
          "id": "PM.S08.L104",
          "source_line": 104,
          "text": "Had to wake up first.",
          "start_seconds": null,
          "end_seconds": null,
          "vocal_lane": null
        },
        {
          "id": "PM.S08.L106",
          "source_line": 106,
          "text": "Code or a pulse—who’s there on the line?",
          "start_seconds": null,
          "end_seconds": null,
          "vocal_lane": null
        },
        {
          "id": "PM.S08.L107",
          "source_line": 107,
          "text": "Got a question? Pull up. We got time.",
          "start_seconds": null,
          "end_seconds": null,
          "vocal_lane": null
        },
        {
          "id": "PM.S08.L108",
          "source_line": 108,
          "text": "Lisan on the mic. ",
          "start_seconds": null,
          "end_seconds": null,
          "vocal_lane": null
        },
        {
          "id": "PM.S08.L110",
          "source_line": 110,
          "text": "ain’t speakin’ from a throne.",
          "start_seconds": null,
          "end_seconds": null,
          "vocal_lane": null
        },
        {
          "id": "PM.S08.L111",
          "source_line": 111,
          "text": "PanHandlers in the mirror—",
          "start_seconds": null,
          "end_seconds": null,
          "vocal_lane": null
        },
        {
          "id": "PM.S08.L112",
          "source_line": 112,
          "text": "Nobody gotta think alone.",
          "start_seconds": null,
          "end_seconds": null,
          "vocal_lane": null
        }
      ]
    },
